ting an article about strategies for choosing a profession.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "editor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the person responsible for deciding on the content of publications like newspapers or magazines ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You know how our editor is strict about deadlines.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lawyer  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who defends people in the legal system, or tries to prove they are guilty of a crime ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Working as a lawyer is difficult.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to verify ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to make sure ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you verify if I got any phone calls? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "journalist ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who communicates factual information to the public in different ways", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm a new freelance journalist with Cambridge Life.    ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "article", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a factual text appearing in a newspaper or magazine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "